# @synarava packages publish to GitHub Packages (org synarava).
# Auth must live in user-level ~/.npmrc (pnpm does not expand ${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
# from a committed project .npmrc). Use:
#   node scripts/ensure-github-packages-auth.mjs
# or CI/Railway steps documented in docs/runbooks/deploy.md.
@synarava:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
